{
  "name": "ColorMe Toon — توليد صفحات التلوين",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ColorMe Toon\n1. **Webhook**: بيستقبل الطلب من الموقع بعد الدفع (محمي بـ Header Auth).\n2. بيحمّل صورة الطفل.\n3. بيقسم الطلب لـ 10 صفحات (برومبت لكل صفحة).\n4. **OpenAI** بيرسم كل صفحة من صورة الطفل + البرومبت.\n5. بيبعت كل صفحة للموقع أول ما تخلص. الموقع بيقفل الطلب لوحده لما يوصل 10.\n\n**قبل التفعيل:** اختار الـ Credentials في 3 نودز: Webhook و Send page to site (نفس Header Auth)، و Generate page (OpenAI).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "a1f1c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-260, -140]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "colorme-toon",
        "authentication": "headerAuth",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f1c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [220, 200],
      "webhookId": "5c0f6d0e-9b0a-4c55-9a40-c010e7007001"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.body.photoUrl }}",
        "options": {
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file",
              "outputPropertyName": "photo"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a1f1c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Download child photo",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [440, 200],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// بيحوّل الطلب لـ 10 عناصر: عنصر لكل صفحة، ومعاه صورة الطفل\nconst order = $('Webhook').first().json.body;\nconst photo = $input.first().binary.photo;\nconst count = order.imagesCount || 10;\nconst prompts = (order.suggestedPrompts || []).slice(0, count);\n\n// لو العميل كتب ملاحظات (حيوان أليف، لون الشعر...) نضيفها لكل برومبت\nconst extra = order.notes ? ` Extra details from the parent (may be Arabic, translate them): ${order.notes}` : '';\nconst likeness = ' Keep the child\\'s face, hairstyle and features recognizable from the reference photo, but drawn as a simple cartoon. Output must be pure black outlines on a white background, no color, no gray, suitable for printing on A4.';\n\nreturn prompts.map((p, i) => ({\n  json: {\n    orderId: order.orderId,\n    callbackUrl: order.callbackUrl,\n    page: i + 1,\n    prompt: p + likeness + extra,\n  },\n  binary: { photo },\n}));"
      },
      "id": "a1f1c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Split into 10 pages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [660, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.openai.com/v1/images/edits",
        "authentication": "predefinedCredentialType",
        "nodeCredentialType": "openAiApi",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "model", "value": "gpt-image-2" },
            { "name": "prompt", "value": "={{ $json.prompt }}" },
            { "parameterType": "formBinaryData", "name": "image", "inputDataFieldName": "photo" },
            { "name": "size", "value": "1024x1536" },
            { "name": "quality", "value": "medium" },
            { "name": "n", "value": "1" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "batching": { "batch": { "batchSize": 2, "batchInterval": 2000 } },
          "timeout": 240000
        }
      },
      "id": "a1f1c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Generate page (OpenAI)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [880, 200],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toBinary",
        "sourceProperty": "data[0].b64_json",
        "binaryPropertyName": "image",
        "options": {
          "fileName": "=page-{{ $('Split into 10 pages').item.json.page }}.png",
          "mimeType": "image/png"
        }
      },
      "id": "a1f1c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Base64 to image",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1100, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Split into 10 pages').item.json.callbackUrl }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            { "name": "orderId", "value": "={{ $('Split into 10 pages').item.json.orderId }}" },
            { "name": "append", "value": "true" },
            { "parameterType": "formBinaryData", "name": "images", "inputDataFieldName": "image" }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1f1c0de-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Send page to site",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1320, 200],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook": { "main": [[{ "node": "Download child photo", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Download child photo": { "main": [[{ "node": "Split into 10 pages", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Split into 10 pages": { "main": [[{ "node": "Generate page (OpenAI)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Generate page (OpenAI)": { "main": [[{ "node": "Base64 to image", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] },
    "Base64 to image": { "main": [[{ "node": "Send page to site", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]] }
  },
  "settings": { "executionOrder": "v1" },
  "pinData": {}
}
